sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SA as Super Admin
    participant AdminUI as Admin Portal
    participant API as Express Server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant Email as Email Service
    participant UserUI as User Dashboard
    actor RM as Retail Manager

    Note over SA, DB: 1. Admin Creates New Plan
    SA->>AdminUI: Fill new plan form & submit
    AdminUI->>API: POST /api/admin/plans
    API->>DB: Insert new plan & 'created' announcement (all users)
    API-->>Email: Dispatch New Plan email to active retailers
    API-->>AdminUI: 201 Plan created successfully

    Note over UserUI, RM: 2. Retail Manager Views Creation Announcement
    RM->>UserUI: Open / refresh Retail Dashboard
    UserUI->>API: GET /api/announcements/unseen
    API->>DB: Query unseen announcement (createdAt >= user.createdAt)
    API-->>UserUI: Return "New Plan Available" announcement
    UserUI-->>RM: Display announcement banner/modal
    RM->>UserUI: Dismiss announcement
    UserUI->>API: POST /api/announcements/:id/seen
    API->>DB: Record seen state in user_announcement_views

    Note over SA, DB: 3. Admin Deactivates Plan
    SA->>AdminUI: Click Deactivate on target plan
    AdminUI->>API: PATCH /api/plans/:id/deactivate
    API->>DB: Set plan status = INACTIVE & create 'deactivated' announcement
    API-->>Email: Send personalized deactivation notice with end date
    API-->>AdminUI: 200 Plan deactivated successfully

    Note over UserUI, RM: 4. Subscribed Retail Manager Views Deactivation Announcement
    RM->>UserUI: Open / refresh Retail Dashboard
    UserUI->>API: GET /api/announcements/unseen
    API->>DB: Query unseen announcement & inject user's personal end date
    API-->>UserUI: Return personalized "Plan Deactivated" announcement
    UserUI-->>RM: Display deactivation notice with billing end date
    RM->>UserUI: Dismiss announcement
    UserUI->>API: POST /api/announcements/:id/seen
    API->>DB: Mark announcement as seen
